###

POST http://localhost:8000/api/graphql
Internal-Auth: -
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer -

{
  "query": "mutation { docCacheByKeyPatch(key: \"foo:1\", patch: {x: {x1: 1, x2: 22}}) }"
}

###

POST http://localhost:8000/api/graphql
Internal-Auth: -
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer -

{
  "query": "mutation { docCacheByKeyPathsDrop(key: \"foo:1\", paths: [\"x\"]) }"
}

###

